// F3: sweep of a 16-gon along a curved path: "sweep did not produce a closed
// solid (self-intersecting or open profile?)". The same with 32 corners or circle() works.
// Status (report 13): open – SMLib leaves seams between side faces open (twin edges
// at distance 0, StitchFaces does not join them); the message now names the cause.
// EXPECT: error-free
sweep(path = [[19, 0, 30], [35, 0, 25], [19, 0, 10]])
    polygon([for (i = [0 : 15]) 3 * [cos(i * 22.5), sin(i * 22.5)]]);
